# Grow from the Ashes cast with its kicker {2} (five mana: Black Lotus's {G}{G}{G} and two Moxen; CR 702.33a): "If this spell
# was kicked, instead search your library for two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle." Two
# Forests may be found, not three and not a Tropical Island, and both enter untapped, after a single shuffle.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Grow from the Ashes
Tropical Island
Llanowar Elves
Plains
Tropical Island
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
